    name: "Heap Block",
    description: "One page of address space, turned flat at a Lathe and laid against the platform's edge. The base grows a single tile, in the one direction you chose. Dearer per tile than a Pillar and far cheaper per purchase — this is the tool for shape, not for area. Permanent: ground, once claimed, is not handed back.",
